(1) CROSSING NUMBER of circular tournament drawing
------------------------------------------------------------
Underlying chord set is always K_n in convex position:
  => raw crossing number = C(n,4) for EVERY tournament (orientation-free). PROVED.
Guy/rectilinear cr(K_n) is SMALLER (optimal placement); convex placement
  gives the maximum, C(n,4). So circular drawing is the 2-page/convex max.

