(2) ROAD COLORING / SYNCHRONIZATION on tiling hypercube
------------------------------------------------------------
Wiggly automaton: 2^F states, F letters, each letter = toggle one bit.
Each letter is a BIJECTION (involution) of states => permutation automaton.
PROVED: a permutation automaton with >1 state has NO synchronizing word.
=> NO reset word collapses all tilings to transitive. Road-coloring FAILS literally.
  n=3: F=1, Q_F diameter = F = 1 (hypercube).
  n=4: F=3, Q_F diameter = F = 3 (hypercube).
